        "language": "english",
        "review": "I really wanted to enjoy this game, but for the life of me I couldn't get into it.  Chinese Room and Detective Story kept me entertained, and the puzzles didn't seem as if the developer was trying to break you.  Mystic Manor's puzzles start off much like CR & DS, but as soon as you get through the 2nd chapter, it goes South.  I'm not a fan of having to use spoilers.  I feel as if it ruins the point in playing the game and I might as well watch someone else on Youtube play.  However, this game drove me to use them, and so much so I stopped caring how it was solved.  I just wanted the game to be over.",
